# Repo-level environment examples (avoid committing secrets).
#
# Backend:
# - copy `backend/env.example` -> `backend/.env` (or set these vars in your shell)
#
# Frontend (CRA):
# - copy `client/env.example` -> `client/.env` (CRA reads `.env`)
#
# Note: this repo blocks committing dotfiles like `.env.example`, so we keep `env.example`.


